                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Is there a type=dbus that should be added here?  Does `phosphor-dump-monitor` expose a dbus service name or is it just a dbus client?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/obmc-dump-monitor.service",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "If I understood it correctly, it is only a D-Bus client. It calls ObjectMapper and Dump.Create."
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/obmc-dump-monitor.service",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
