                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Looks like something to fix here too?  Let's go ahead and remove any \"configuration\" of this and just pick a hard-coded path.  Nobody uses the flexibility of putting this in another location.\n\n\n```\n$ rg bmc_dump_path\nmeta-phosphor/classes/phosphor-debug-collector.bbclass\n1:bmc_dump_path = \"/var/lib/phosphor-debug-collector/dumps\"\n\nmeta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_git.bb\n37:SYSTEMD_SUBSTITUTIONS += \"BMC_DUMP_PATH:${bmc_dump_path}:${MGR_SVC}\"\n49:    -DBMC_DUMP_PATH=${bmc_dump_path} \\\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "probably not necessary"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks! How can I verify it?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "```\n       SyslogIdentifier=\n           Sets the process name (\"syslog tag\") to prefix log lines sent to the logging system or the kernel log\n           buffer with. If not set, defaults to the process name of the executed process. This option is only\n           useful when StandardOutput= or StandardError= are set to journal or kmsg (or to the same settings in\n           combination with +console) and only applies to log messages written to stdout or stderr.\n```\n\nFrom `man systemd.exec`."
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager.service",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
